The '''Precursor Remnants''' is a randomly-generated location in the [[Crystal Hollows]] where [[Automaton]]s will spawn, and can be killed to obtain [[Automaton Parts]]. Inside, the [[Lost Precursor City]] can spawn, where the player can obtain the [[Sapphire Crystal]] by giving [[Automaton Parts]] to [[Professor Robot]].

{{ZoneText|Mine Sapphire Gemstones.|Look out for Automatons!}}

